  "description": "# SIP6.2: Cross-chain Fleet Deployment: DAO_LazyVault_WETH_1 on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to activate the DAO_LazyVault_WETH_1 Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nThis cross-chain fleet deployment will expand the protocol's capabilities across multiple networks.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0x0C1FBCCC019320032D9acD193447560C8C632114\n- Buffer Ark: 0x03548162DeEA204857121F56D362A27C783aF097\n- Number of Arks: 11\n- Curator: 0x447BF9d1485ABDc4C1778025DfdfbE8b894C3796\n\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Add Fleet to Harbor Command\n2. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for BufferArk\n3. Add 11 Arks to the Fleet\n4. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n5. Grant CURATOR_ROLE to Curator for the Fleet\n\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n### Fleet Configuration\n- Deposit Cap: 1,000 (1000000000000000000000 raw)\n- Initial Minimum Buffer Balance: 500 (500000000 raw)\n- Initial Rebalance Cooldown: 10 minutes (600 seconds)\n- Initial Tip Rate: 0.3% (3000000000000000 raw)\n\n",
